msgid "Straightforward returns"
msgstr "بازگشت سرراست"

msgid "A defined window. No maze of small print."
msgstr "یک بازهٔ مشخص. بدون هزارتوی ریزنوشته."

msgid "Secure checkout"
msgstr "پرداخت امن"

msgid "Payment stays with WooCommerce and your gateway."
